{"watch":11,"start":3000,"events":[{"seq":454,"t":3000,"type":"watch","watch":11},{"seq":455,"t":3000,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1673,"retries":0},{"seq":456,"t":3000,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"It is Watch 11. Doctrine: Take middle ford (F2) early, hold it. I have infantry/elephants at SBM (near F2) and archers/cav at NBM (near F2). I must reinforce F2 and press advantage. I will use my forces to secure F2 and hunt any nearby enemy riders."},{"seq":457,"t":3000,"type":"courier","id":"c171","house":"rhino","letter":"L201","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":3000,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":458,"t":3000,"type":"courier","id":"c172","house":"rhino","letter":"L202","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-2","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2","s-mid"],"depart":3000,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":459,"t":3000,"type":"courier","id":"c173","house":"rhino","letter":"L203","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":3000,"plain":"HORSE, SCOUT SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":460,"t":3000,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1572,"retries":0},{"seq":461,"t":3000,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Doctrine dictates taking the east ford early and holding it. All my units are at F3 (East Ford) from W10. I must reinforce this position and maintain control. No new threats are reported."},{"seq":462,"t":3000,"type":"courier","id":"c174","house":"kite","letter":"L204","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":3000,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":463,"t":3000,"type":"courier","id":"c175","house":"kite","letter":"L205","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":3000,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq"